          <h2 class="ah2">Construction services</h2>
          <p class="tx">Plan one project or combine several. We design them together so everything fits.</p>
          <div class="inc">
            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Outdoor backyard design</b><span>We plan your backyard around how you want to use it and show you a 3D design and a written quote before anything is built.</span></p></div>
            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Pavers</b><span>Paver patios, walkways and driveways laid on a properly prepared base.</span></p></div>
            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Retaining walls</b><span>Walls that level a sloping yard, create usable space and add structure.</span></p></div>
            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Decks</b><span>Decks that extend your living space outdoors, built to suit your yard and your home.</span></p></div>
