            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Stone veneer</b><span>Stone facing for walls, steps, pillars and outdoor kitchens.</span></p></div>
            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Outdoor kitchens</b><span>Built-in grill stations and outdoor kitchens for cooking and entertaining outside.</span></p></div>
            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Concrete</b><span>Concrete patios, walkways, pads and steps.</span></p></div>
            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Asphalt</b><span>Asphalt driveways and paved areas, plus asphalt repair and patching.</span></p></div>
            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Carpentry</b><span>Railings and carpentry repairs, along with new decks.</span></p></div>
